    "Author": "Aschy",
    "Name": "Market Master Pro",
    "Punchline": "Manual market intelligence and arbitrage scanner for FFXIV.",
    "Description": "Analyzes market opportunities with Universalis data, watchlists, velocity filters, and manual undercut helpers. All actions are manual. Now includes real-time undercut notifications.",
    "Changelog": "v1.1.36: Installer reliability hotfix - release asset now uses a versioned filename to avoid stale CDN cache and ensure distributed package version matches feed version.\nv1.1.35: Reissued release package on a fresh tag to bypass stale CDN artifact and restore install/update reliability for latest opportunities persistence update.\nv1.1.34: Scanner now persists the most recent opportunities and keeps them visible until a new scan completes; latest opportunity snapshot is restored on startup.\nv1.1.33: Stability pass: opportunities table now supports row caps, compact mode, and optional detailed tooltips; exclusion inspector now uses TTL caching with refresh debounce; added pluginmaster feed validation script for safer releases.",
